Package: scroll
Type: Package
Title: Scroll-Driven Single-Cell Stories from Seurat Objects
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Shihan", "Li", email = "shihanli1992@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Turns a processed Seurat object into an interactive, scroll-driven
    web story for presenting single-cell analyses. A heavy offline build phase
    extracts lightweight on-disk artifacts (metadata and embeddings as a small
    Parquet table, expression as a feature-partitioned Parquet store) that a
    memory-light Quarto closeread + Shiny runtime reads one feature at a time,
    so runtime memory stays flat regardless of matrix size.
